Subject: [PATCH 02/14] exams: shared upload validator, fail-closed sanitizing,
 escaped emails

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_011d4mgSxngjRmAXosGe4ry4

- New apps/exams/uploads.py: one size/extension/content check for every
  upload; magic bytes must match the extension (a PDF named .png or a WAV
  named .webp is refused).
- Exam.save no longer swallows sanitizer errors (it used to store raw HTML).
- Exam notification emails escape tutor-entered text in the HTML body.
- Submitted answer-sheet URLs must be http(s) or a server path.
- Re-grading after an answer-key edit runs in the same transaction as the edit.
- Tutor exam list counts group members in the list query (no query per exam).
